{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46931","headline":"荆渚逢禅友 · 齐己","name":"荆渚逢禅友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泽国相逢话一宵，云山偶别隔前朝。\n社思匡岳无宗炳，诗忆扬州有鲍昭。\n晨野黍离春漠漠，水天星粲夜遥遥。\n闲吟莫忘传心祖，曾立阶前雪到腰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}